This file describes the scripts (contained in this directory and the 
old_scripts sub-directory) that are not part of the GMOS acceptance 
test procedure. Several such scripts have been written to help with
the development and testing of the instrument.

-----------------------------------------------

./dumpFits - Reads the GMOS status records and dumps the contents
             to a file resembling a FITS header. This script
             simulates what the OCS will do when an observation
             completes.

./flexLog - developed for the flexure tests. Script will prompt for 
            configuration details for the science images, and allow 
            user to initiate a set of three "hartmann mask" images,
            and N WFS images.

./flexLog_sciOnly - as above, but without taking WFS images. This is
                    for use whilst the WFS controller is faulty.

./focusLog -  developed for focus runs. Takes a series of Science
              images with the translation assembly z-stage at different
              positions.

./focusLogSim - as above, simulation mode.

./logFilterSwitches - for testing the integrity of the filter wheel 2 in
                      position switches and electronics. Also a test of
                      EPICS monitoring software. Script slowly moves the 
                      wheel for one revolution whilst monitoring the 
                      switch state.

./logFilterSwitchesSim - as above, simulation mode.

./logImages <pause (minutes)> - written for the GMOS cold tests. The script
                                takes a triplet of "hartmann images" from
                                the science camera - moving the filter wheels
                                to achieve this, and then pauses for the 
                                specified time. The script will repeat this
                                cycle until stopped

./logImagesSim <pause (minutes)> - as above, simulation mode.

./logTemps <pause (minutes)> - written for the GMOS cold tests. The script 
                               periodically logs the measured temperatures 
                               from the components controller and detector
                               controller

./logTempsSim <pause (minutes)> - as above, simulation mode.

./turretSimUpdateCP - Simulates a grating assembly UPDATE at periodic
                      intervals to test the CP grating turret. Runs
                      continuously until interrupted.

./hartAB - allows the user to take, when ready, a pair of images using teh hartmann A and B masks installed in the filter wheels.

./hartCD - allows the user to take, when ready, a pair of images using teh hartmann C and D masks installed in the filter wheels.

./hartABCD - allows the user to take, when ready, a quartet of images using teh hartmann A, B, C and D masks installed in the filter wheels.

./hartFocusRun - child of the focusLog and hartABCD scripts. Takes the hartmann quartet several times, incrementing the translation stage z-position as it does so.

./wfsImageLog - <pause (minutes)> - periodically take and log WFS images.

-----------------------------------------------------

./old_scripts/checkTurretBacklash - repeatedly calls "checout turretBacklash 
                                    -auto". Obsolete.

./old_scripts/gratingJiggle - repeatedly take images, "jiggling" the grating 
                              (mirror) tilt to remove residual stresses. Now
                              obsolete as software incorporates jiggling.

./old_scripts/gratingJiggleSim - as above, simulation mode.

./old_scripts/gratingRepeat - written for the jiggle-juggle tests. Now obsolete.

./old_scripts/gratingRepeatNonContact - as gratingRepeat, non-contact mode. Obsolete.

./old_scripts/gratingRepeatSim - as gratingRepeat, simulation mode. Obsolete.

./old_scripts/logDisplacements - Version of logImages with jiggling. Obsolete

./old_scripts/logDisplacementsSim - as above, simulation mode.



